# dense-1/8: Qwen3-8B DSpark dense drafter, 2 layers, 1/4 attention width, 1/8-width MLP

Branch `dense-1/8` of https://github.com/yushengsu-thu/SpecForge (based on `spark-Qwen3-8B`).
One experiment: the Qwen3-8B dense DSpark drafter of the dense-vs-MoE comparison
(`docs/recipes/qwen3-8b-dspark-moe-disaggregated.md`) shrunk in structure only: 2 layers instead
of 5, attention width 1/4 (GQA 8/2 heads x 128), MLP hidden dim 1/8 (1536); residual hidden stays
4096. Trained for 12 epochs on the Open Perfect Blend regen corpus.

