## Target

| | |
| --- | --- |
| target | `Qwen/Qwen3-8B` (36 layers, hidden 4096, vocab 151936), bf16, served by SGLang capture servers |
| embedding | draft uses the target `model.embed_tokens.weight` (`load_target_embedding: true`) and the target `lm_head` |
| target feature layers | 1, 9, 17, 25, 33 (`dspark` projector: 5 x 4096 -> 4096), kept at 5 although the draft has 2 layers |

## Draft model (`configs/qwen3-8b-dspark-dense-1-8-2layer-causal-noconf-b16.json`)

| | dense arm (`qwen3-8b-dspark-noconf-b16.json`) | **dense-1/8 (this run)** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| architecture | DSparkDraftModel, bidirectional attention inside the block | DSparkDraftModel, **causal** draft block (`is_causal: true`, as in the published jiapingW config) |
| block_size | 16 | 16 |
| layers | 5, all full attention | **2**, all full attention |
| residual hidden | 4096 (= target hidden) | 4096 (unchanged: tied to the target embed_tokens / lm_head / projector) |
| **MLP intermediate_size** | 12288 | **1536 (1/8)** |
| attention | GQA 32 heads / 8 KV heads, head_dim 128 | **GQA 8 heads / 2 KV heads**, head_dim 128 (attention width 1024 instead of 4096) |
| Markov head | vanilla, rank 256 | same |
| confidence head | off (`enable_confidence_head: false`, alpha 0) | same |
| mask_token_id | 151669 | same |
| rope_theta / max_position_embeddings | 1e6 / 40960 | same |
| vocab | 151936, `tie_word_embeddings: false` | same |
| parameters (layers + projector + Markov head) | ~1.05B | ~0.22B (2 x 29M + 84M projector + 78M Markov head) |

The upstream PR #942 stack (#957-#963, jiapingW's split of #942 onto main) is merged into this
fork, so the published run's `is_causal: true`, `ddp_bucket_cap_mb: 128` and its projection
knobs are used here, under the names #963 gave them: `flatten_vocab_projection: true` and
`cache_vocab_projection: true` (the published launch.yaml still says `dspark_*_projection`).
The fork's dense and MoE arms were trained before the merge, without them.

